#: ../../Rapid_Mix/RM_Theory_and_Future_Work.rst:228
#, python-format
msgid ""
"`The maximum velocity gradient "
"<https://colab.research.google.com/drive/1tq6eHiIw47JGIPd4P_16AsewbC5GsEMk#scrollTo=6cWi2zks8tiD&line=10&uniqifier=1>`_"
"  that can be used to achieve 80% coagulant nanoparticle attachment using 50"
" cm of head loss is 283 Hz. This requires a residence time of 61 seconds. "
