"that the model will need to be modified."
msgstr ""
"`El gradiente máximo de velocidad "
"<https://colab.research.google.com/drive/1tq6eHiIw47JGIPd4P_16AsewbC5GsEMk#scrollTo=6cWi2zks8tiD&line=10&uniqifier=1>`_"
